])(y-\\text{E}[Y])f(x,y).\n$$\n\nFirst, let's find the marginal mass functions for $X$ and $Y.$ These are given by the row and column totals, respectively.\n\n| $f$ | $Y=0$ | $Y=1$ | ${f}_{X}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.25$ | $0.15$ | $0.4$ |\n| $X=2$ | $0.6$ | $0$ | $0.6$ |\n| ${f}_{Y}$ | $0.85$ | $0.15$ | $1$ |\n\nWe now compute $\\text{E}[X]$ and $\\text{E}[Y],$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in {S}_{X}}x\\cdot {f}_{X}(x) \\\\  & =0\\cdot 0.4+2\\cdot 0.6 \\\\  & =0+1.2 \\\\  & =1.2 \\\\ \\text{E}[Y] & ={\\sum }_{y\\in {S}_{Y}}y\\cdot {f}_{Y}(y) \\\\  & =0\\cdot 0.85+1\\cdot 0.15 \\\\  & =0+0.15 \\\\  & =0.15\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the formula for the covariance, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}[X,Y] & ={\\sum }_{(x,y)\\in S}(x-\\text{E}[X])(y-\\text{E}[Y])f(x,y) \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{(x,y)\\in S}(x-1.2)(y-0.15)f(x,y) \\\\  & =(0-1.2)(0-0.15)f(0,0) \\\\  & +(0-1.2)(1-0.15)f(0,1) \\\\  & +(2-1.2)(0-0.15)f(2,0) \\\\  & +(2-1.2)(1-0.15)f(2,1) \\\\  & =(-1.2)(-0.15)(0.25) \\\\  & +(-1.2)(0.85)(0.15) \\\\  & +(0.8)(-0.15)(0.6) \\\\  & +(0.8)(0.85)(0) \\\\  & =-0.18.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-29a09d79-668a-5d76-93b7-d90b94b6b6a1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-3ffdfa5d-c95f-54fd-857a-e11023b0bfbe" :answer-field/id #uuid "3ffdfa5d-c95f-54fd-857a-e11023b0bfbe"] ["answer-63fbbf28-a5eb-5784-8ae2-bdb3e9bd5c6c" :answer/id #uuid "63fbbf28-a5eb-5784-8ae2-bdb3e9bd5c6c"] ["answer-63fbbf28-a5eb-5784-8ae2-bdb3e9bd5c6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-63fbbf28-a5eb-5784-8ae2-bdb3e9bd5c6c" :answer/value "-0.06"] ["answer-3ed2e7fa-1b4e-554a-9f21-5c4c18fb3212" :answer/id #uuid "3ed2e7fa-1b4e-554a-9f21-5c4c18fb3212"] ["answer-3ed2e7fa-1b4e-554a-9f21-5c4c18fb3212" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3ed2e7fa-1b4e-554a-9f21-5c4c18fb3212" :answer/value "-0.09"] ["answer-4995e421-f57e-506e-949a-56fe54b64747" :answer/id #uuid "4995e421-f57e-506e-949a-56fe54b64747"] ["answer-4