b-a520-d910d32ed247" :question/problem "If $\\text{E}[X]=5.5,$ $\\text{E}[Y]=4.38,$ and $\\text{E}[XY]=24.12$ for two random variables $X$ and $Y,$ calculate the covariance of $X$ and $Y.$"] ["question-7980335d-9e66-542b-a520-d910d32ed247" :question/worked-solution "The covariance of $X$ and $Y$ can be calculated using the formula\n\n$$\n\\text{Cov}[X,Y]=\\text{E}[XY]-\\text{E}[X]\\cdot \\text{E}[Y].\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given values, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}[X,Y] & =\\text{E}[XY]-\\text{E}[X]\\cdot \\text{E}[Y] \\\\  & =24.12-(5.5)\\cdot (4.38) \\\\  & =0.03.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the covariance of $X$ and $Y$ is $0.03.$"] ["question-7980335d-9e66-542b-a520-d910d32ed247" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-c0679843-7790-5fe7-98d3-601893fb4657" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0679843-7790-5fe7-98d3-601893fb4657"] ["answer-c46f447f-df24-5902-9689-fea13287bce2" :answer/id #uuid "c46f447f-df24-5902-9689-fea13287bce2"] ["answer-c46f447f-df24-5902-9689-fea13287bce2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c46f447f-df24-5902-9689-fea13287bce2" :answer/value "0.03"] ["answer-b9b31986-b655-51df-be39-4f4da4a378d8" :answer/id #uuid "b9b31986-b655-51df-be39-4f4da4a378d8"] ["answer-b9b31986-b655-51df-be39-4f4da4a378d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b9b31986-b655-51df-be39-4f4da4a378d8" :answer/value "0.07"] ["answer-5534a32e-c646-5abb-8671-2e12e1a26b9a" :answer/id #uuid "5534a32e-c646-5abb-8671-2e12e1a26b9a"] ["answer-5534a32e-c646-5abb-8671-2e12e1a26b9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5534a32e-c646-5abb-8671-2e12e1a26b9a" :answer/value "0.12"] ["answer-763c6049-7824-5f86-a7d7-d2da13ebd71a" :answer/id #uuid "763c6049-7824-5f86-a7d7-d2da13ebd71a"] ["answer-763c6049-7824-5f86-a7d7-d2da13ebd71a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-763c6049-7824-5f86-a7d7-d2da13ebd71a" :answer/value "0.15"] ["answer-bd241af9-776b-59c5-81bc-13df08d53c71" :answer/id #uuid "bd241af9-776b-59c5-81bc-13df08d53c71"] ["answer-bd2